    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just dont feel like i need a professional to tell me what i already know. it just feels like a cycle that never ends. and honestly, if i just... let go, it wouldn't even be a tragedy. it would be like a quiet thing that just happens. no big scene, no one even rushing to help because they wouldn't even know. doesnt that sound almost peaceful? just fading out without a fuss?",
